"Q-O-0007","Transcription-Outgoing Call with +14046637285","OWNED_PROOF","operator_paste","Readymerce sales calls — US","Transcription-Outgoing Call with +14046637285","NULL","NULL","transcript","Transcription-Outgoing Call with +14046637285.txt","O-7e217243","2026-09 (SAMPLE — file date)","2026-09-24","NULL","NULL","NULL","N","[R-OWNED]","RC-OWNED","VOC-OWNED-US","I get Social Security, so I need to protect that","I'm gonna let him put you in his name because I get Social Security, so I need to protect that. And he works. That's why I use him.","NULL","NULL","NULL","2.8","PB-02","CP-01","CP-01","NULL","NULL","NULL","NULL","NULL","NULL","call_market: US; employment: NULL; funds: receives Social Security, structuring purchase through business partner Brian's name; household: has a business partner (Brian)","spend|belief|tradeoff","NULL","AW-4","Readymerce $500 store package","seeker","protecting Social Security by using a partner's name","VERBATIM_VOC","NULL","NULL","NULL","NULL","call_outcome: BOOKED-FOLLOWUP; lead_quality_marker: no personal funds disclosed as income source — receives Social Security and is putting the store in a partner's name to protect benefits"
